('4edcae42-02e7-57fb-9600-56ccb1154a47', '3fd36cc2-d7e7-4424-b4b5-11a4a8b7ac04', '932c79b4-ef68-44f7-9381-87d5ddebfa17', 'a-level', '25.5', '9702 coursebook 25.5 · Discovering the electron', 26, 26, 'In a fine-beam tube at fixed B, why is the radius proportional to √V?', NULL, 2, 'multiple_choice'::answer_type, 'The speed is proportional to √V and the radius is proportional to the speed', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, '½mv² = eV gives v ∝ √V; r = mv/eB ∝ v. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: v ∝ √V. C1: r ∝ v. A1: A (The speed is proportional to √V and the radius is proportional to the speed).', 3, NULL, NULL),
('8856e0ea-3303-566b-8dca-d6ca546f8df4', '3fd36cc2-d7e7-4424-b4b5-11a4a8b7ac04', '932c79b4-ef68-44f7-9381-87d5ddebfa17', 'a-level', '25.5', '9702 coursebook 25.5 · Discovering the electron', 27, 27, 'Thomson''s beam is undeflected with E = 2.0 × 10⁴ V m⁻¹ and B = 1.0 mT. With the electric field removed, the beam follows a circle of radius 11.4 cm. Calculate e/m, in units of 10¹¹ C kg⁻¹.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '1.754', '10¹¹ C kg⁻¹', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'v = E/B = 2.0 × 10⁴ ÷ 1.0 × 10⁻³ = 2.0 × 10⁷ m s⁻¹. e/m = v/(Br) = 2.0 × 10⁷ ÷ (1.0 × 10⁻³ × 0.114) = 1.75 × 10¹¹ C kg⁻¹. Mark scheme (4 marks). C1: v = E/B. M1: e/m = v/(Br). C1: value. A1: e/m = 1.75 × 10¹¹ C kg⁻¹.', 4, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 440 242" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg77fe3290-t fg77fe3290-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg77fe3290-t">Thomson''s crossed fields</title><desc id="fg77fe3290-d">Crossed fields with E = 2.0 × 10⁴ V m⁻¹ and B = 1.0 mT leave the electron beam undeflected; with E removed the beam follows a circle of radius 11.4 cm.</desc><rect x="120" y="42" width="220" height="8" rx="0" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:var(--fig-fill,rgba(29,78,216,0.10));stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><rect x="120" y="160" width="220" height="8" rx="0" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:var(--fig-fill,rgba(29,78,216,0.10));stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="108" y="46" font-size="14" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor;font-weight:700">+</text><text x="108" y="164" font-size="14" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor;font-weight:700">−</text><line x1="139.3" y1="68.3" x2="147.3" y2="76.3" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="139.3" y1="76