('56532e34-1f8c-5315-a9b9-52d53b095478', '3fd36cc2-d7e7-4424-b4b5-11a4a8b7ac04', '932c79b4-ef68-44f7-9381-87d5ddebfa17', 'a-level', '25.5', '9702 coursebook 25.5 · Discovering the electron', 28, 28, 'Calculate the flux density needed to make electrons accelerated through 300 V follow a circle of radius 5.0 cm, in mT. Take e/m = 1.76 × 10¹¹ C kg⁻¹.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '1.168 mT', 'mT', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'B = √(2V/(e/m)) ÷ r = √(600 ÷ 1.76 × 10¹¹) ÷ 0.050 = 0.00117 T. In mT: 0.001168 × 1000 = 1.17. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: rearranged. C1: conversion. A1: B = 1.17 mT.', 3, NULL, NULL),
('a6bf8a8a-7ac0-5e31-ad6d-ef9cd77fbbfb', '3fd36cc2-d7e7-4424-b4b5-11a4a8b7ac04', '932c79b4-ef68-44f7-9381-87d5ddebfa17', 'a-level', '25.5', '9702 coursebook 25.5 · Discovering the electron', 29, 29, 'In a fine-beam tube, the accelerating p.d. is increased while B stays the same. What happens to the circle?', NULL, 2, 'multiple_choice'::answer_type, 'Its radius increases', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, 'Faster electrons need a larger circle: r ∝ √V. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: v increases. C1: r ∝ v. A1: D (Its radius increases).', 3, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 260" role="img" aria-labelledby="fgc1e34ae4-t fgc1e34ae4-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fgc1e34ae4-t">Fine-beam tube</title><desc id="fgc1e34ae4-d">In a fine-beam tube, electrons from an electron gun follow a circular path in a uniform magnetic field directed into the page.</desc><line x1="30" y1="27.5" x2="38" y2="35.5" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="30" y1="35.5" x2="38" y2="27.5" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="30" y1="62.5" x2="38" y2="70.5" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="30" y1="70.5" x2="38" y2="62.5" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="30" y1="97.5" x2="38" y2="105.5" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="30" y1="105.5" x2="38" y2="97.5" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="30" y1="132.5" x2="38" y2="140.5" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);st